<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>RSX Alliance - Player Center</title>
  <style>
    /* Global Styles & Reset */
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Rajdhani', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #0b0a12;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 100%, rgba(255, 140, 0, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
      color: #ffffff;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    /* Page Header */
    .header-section {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .header-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9d00, #ff5500, #d43f8d);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 157, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .header-subtitle {
      color: #9a94b8;
      font-size: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    /* Cards Grid Container */
    .player-center-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .player-center-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    /* Card Item (Плашка) */
    .center-card {
      position: relative;
      background: rgba(18, 16, 31, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid rgba(224, 169, 56, 0.25);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      min-height: 280px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: pointer;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    /* Background Image with High Transparency */
    .card-bg-image {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      opacity: 0.18; /* High transparency / большая прозрачность */
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.5s ease;
      z-index: 1;
      filter: saturate(1.2);
    }

    /* Gradient Overlay */
    .card-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18, 16, 31, 0.4) 0%, rgba(18, 16, 31, 0.92) 100%);
      z-index: 2;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* Content Area */
    .card-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    /* Top Badge */
    .card-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #ff9d00;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card-badge::before {
      content: '';
      display: inline-block;
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background-color: #ff9d00;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff9d00;
    }

    /* Title */
    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Description */
    .card-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #a39ebc;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Button inside card */
    .card-button-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .card-btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      background: rgba(255, 157, 0, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 157, 0, 0.4);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #ffbd59;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    /* Hover State - Block highlights like a button */
    .center-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      border-color: #ff9d00;
      background: rgba(28, 24, 48, 0.92);
      box-shadow: 
        0 0 30px rgba(255, 157, 0, 0.35),
        inset 0 0 20px rgba(255, 157, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .center-card:hover .card-bg-image {
      opacity: 0.38; /* Brightens up on hover */
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    .center-card:hover .card-title {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    }

    .center-card:hover .card-btn {
      background: #ff9d00;
      color: #0d0a1a;
      border-color: #ff9d00;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 157, 0, 0.6);
    }

    /* Custom glow themes for cards */
    .card-war:hover {
      border-color: #ff4500;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.4), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.15);
    }
    .card-war .card-badge { color: #ff5533; }
    .card-war .card-badge::before { background-color: #ff5533; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff5533; }
    .card-war:hover .card-btn { background: #ff4500; border-color: #ff4500; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.6); }

    .card-r4:hover {
      border-color: #e0a938;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(224, 169, 56, 0.4), inset 0 0 20px rgba(224, 169, 56, 0.15);
    }

    .card-row:hover {
      border-color: #9d4edd;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.4), inset 0 0 20px rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.15);
    }
    .card-row .card-badge { color: #c77dff; }
    .card-row .card-badge::before { background-color: #c77dff; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #c77dff; }
    .card-row:hover .card-btn { background: #9d4edd; border-color: #9d4edd; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.6); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="header-section">
    <h1 class="header-title">Player Command Center</h1>
    <p class="header-subtitle">RSX Alliance Central Operations & Applications</p>
  </div>

  <div class="player-center-grid">

    <!-- Card 1: WAR MERITS -->
    <div class="center-card card-war" onclick="openTerminal('war_merits')">
      <!-- Background Image with High Transparency -->
      <img src="image1.jpg" alt="War Merits" class="card-bg-image">
      <div class="card-overlay"></div>

      <div class="card-content">
        <div class="card-badge">Combat Stats</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">War Merits</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">Следите за своим прогрессом в получении боевых заслуг, анализируйте статистику сражений и проверяйте свои награды.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-button-wrapper">
        <button class="card-btn">
          <span>Открыть прогресс</span>
          &rarr;
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: R4 APPLICATIONS -->
    <div class="center-card card-r4" onclick="openTerminal('r4_app')">
      <!-- Background Image with High Transparency -->
      <img src="image2.jpg" alt="R4 Applications" class="card-bg-image">
      <div class="card-overlay"></div>

      <div class="card-content">
        <div class="card-badge">High Command</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">R4 Applications</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">Подайте заявку на звание офицера RSX. Вступите в офицерский корпус для координации военных стратегий и управления союзом.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-button-wrapper">
        <button class="card-btn">
          <span>Подать заявку</span>
          &rarr;
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: ROW LEGACY -->
    <div class="center-card card-row" onclick="openTerminal('row_legacy')">
      <!-- Background Image with High Transparency -->
      <img src="image3.jpg" alt="ROW Legacy" class="card-bg-image">
      <div class="card-overlay"></div>

      <div class="card-content">
        <div class="card-badge">Tournament Portal</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">ROW Legacy</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">Подайте заявку на участие в ROW LEGACY. Подтвердите свои боевые навыки и сразитесь в турнирном дивизионе альянса.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-button-wrapper">
        <button class="card-btn">
          <span>Участвовать в ROW</span>
          &rarr;
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    function openTerminal(type) {
      console.log("Opening section:", type);
      // Terminal ykn modal banuuf koodii keessan hunda asitti galchuu dhesstuu
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
